  "finding": "On Windows, signal 0 is CTRL_C_EVENT and the os.kill implementation may call GenerateConsoleCtrlEvent. It is not a side-effect-free process liveness query. Other non-console signal values may call TerminateProcess. Desktop lease liveness must use read-only Win32 process queries and creation identity.",
